WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.647
Imagine a small organization chart.

00:00:02.647 --> 00:00:05.127
The president is at level zero.

00:00:05.127 --> 00:00:09.407
Two directors report to the president, so they are at level one.

00:00:09.407 --> 00:00:13.452
Managers who report to those directors are at level two.

00:00:13.452 --> 00:00:20.897
A recursive query can build that structure automatically from the manager relationship stored in the employee table.

00:00:20.897 --> 00:00:26.597
The important idea is that the source table does not need one column for every level.

00:00:26.597 --> 00:00:31.804
The hierarchy is discovered by repeatedly following the parent and child relationship.
